## P4 — Student, lifestyle, and shareable sheets

Ideas from 2026-10 research into what Gen Z and Gen Alpha build in Notion and share on TikTok. Each needs its own object and material, not a shared look. Shortlist for a first batch: Internship & Job Tracker, College Apps Tracker, Household Chores, Digital Closet, Project Pan, Resale Tracker, Wishlist with Cooling-Off, Scratch-Off Bucket List, Collection Tracker, Practice Log, MASH, Personality Stack Card, Birth Chart Card.

### School

- [ ] **Internship & Job Tracker** — Work / Instrument — Move applications through applied, assessment, interview, offer, and rejected, with follow-up dates and a coffee-chat log. **Visual:** lanyard badge with a stamped status per row. Built in `examples/slops/internship-tracker`; awaiting the quality review and not yet in `bundled.json`.
- [ ] **College Apps Tracker** — Planning / Paper — Track reach, target, and safety schools with deadlines, essay and recommendation status, fees, and scholarships, and show what is due next. **Visual:** a stack of admissions folders with coloured tabs.
- [ ] **Course Card** — Learning / Paper — Keep one class's professor, room, office hours, grading weights, key dates, textbook, and policies on a single reference card. **Visual:** university ID card crossed with a syllabus cover.
- [ ] **Degree Map** — Learning / Paper + Instrument — Fill gen-ed, major, and elective requirement buckets with courses and watch credits climb toward graduation on a four-year grid. **Visual:** video-game skill tree.
- [ ] **Exam Prep Board** — Learning / Instrument — Per exam, list weight, date, and topics with a red/amber/green confidence rating, so the weakest topics surface first. **Visual:** mission-control readiness panel.
- [ ] **Paper Planner** — Writing / Paper — Plan an essay from thesis to argument blocks and sources, with a word-count bar against the deadline. **Visual:** clipboard of index cards with a highlighter.
- [ ] **Service Hours Log** — School / Paper — Log volunteer and activity hours with date, supervisor, and a signature line, and export a clean sheet to hand in. **Visual:** punch time-card.
- [ ] **Household Chores** — Home / Instrument + Paper — Rotate chores by person and day for roommates, families, or kids, with tap-to-complete, a fairness tally, optional points, and house rules. Replaces the Cleaning Schedule line in P2. **Visual:** magnetic fridge chore wheel with a spinning dial and coloured person-magnets. Built in `examples/slops/household-chores`; awaiting the quality review and not yet in `bundled.json`.
- [ ] **Group Project Split** — Work / Paper — Assign roles, tasks, owners, and deadlines, then export a PNG for the group chat. **Visual:** pie chart cut into slices with owner chips.

### Fashion, beauty, and lifestyle

