### Quizzes, fortunes, and personality sheets

Each ends in one card meant to be exported and posted.

- [ ] **MASH** — Games / Skin — Fill mansion, apartment, shack, and house categories with your own picks, draw the spiral, and eliminate to a shareable future card. **Visual:** spiral-notebook page in gel pen with a pencil spiral. Built in `examples/slops/mash`; awaiting the quality review and not yet in `bundled.json`.
